      "activation": "pv12",
      "surfaces": [
        "transaction-encoding"
      ],
      "compatibility": "encode-break",
      "basis": "source-verified",
      "summary": "When a submitted transaction's era differs from the ledger tip, consensus re-serializes it and decodes it in the tip era; it is rejected with an era mismatch if those bytes are not valid Dijkstra. On the devnet, Conway-built payments, deposit registrations, required_signers bodies and metadata transactions are accepted; a Conway deposit-less registration is rejected as an era mismatch (devnet check cross-era-submission).",
